       "24x24": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/5fca8aeffacfd6007656bf65/9af2a4f1-6b52-480b-a69f-d59b265be598/24",
       "32x32": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/5fca8aeffacfd6007656bf65/9af2a4f1-6b52-480b-a69f-d59b265be598/32",
       "48x48": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/5fca8aeffacfd6007656bf65/9af2a4f1-6b52-480b-a69f-d59b265be598/48"
      },
      "displayName": "Esmé Cowles",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=5fca8aeffacfd6007656bf65",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "I just verified that 4.7.2 builds fine for me, and bisected the commits between then and master.  It looks like the offending commit is ",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "marks": [
           {
            "attrs": {
             "href": "https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/commit/b00873e7d47ecf9f266e3628fcb9270e35edcc9c"
            },
            "type": "link"
           }
          ],
          "text": "https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/commit/b00873e7d47ecf9f266e3628fcb9270e35edcc9c",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "text": " (consolidating the spring config).  Maybe an unintentional change to the config is the source of the problem?",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "Update: my mistake — of course it's the parallel rdf output: ",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "marks": [
           {
            "attrs": {
             "href": "https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/commit/cd5b69e2b8e85f13651fe7e88e88c6d7154105c6"
            },
            "type": "link"
           }
          ],
          "text": "https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/commit/cd5b69e2b8e85f13651fe7e88e88c6d7154105c6",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       }
      ],
      "type": "doc",
      "version": 1
