  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "When doing a build with parallelization turned on (e.g.,  mvn -Dfcrepo.streaming.parallel=true clean install), I am seeing intermittent failures in these three ITs:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "FedoraLdpIT.testReplaceGraph:765 expected:<204> but was:<500>",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "FedoraLdpIT.testRoundTripReplaceGraph:831 expected:<204> but was:<500>",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "FedoraLdpIT.testRoundTripReplaceGraphForDatastreamDescription:1952 expected:<204> but was:<500>",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "If I do the same build with parallization turned off, the build succeeds.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
