     },
     "body": "<p>Travis intermittently has shown the same errors:</p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://travis-ci.org/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/builds\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://travis-ci.org/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/builds</a></p>",
     "created": "19/May/17 6:16 PM",
     "id": "18808",
     "jsdPublic": true,
