    {
     "author": {
      "accountId": "5fca8aeffacfd6007656bf65",
      "accountType": "atlassian",
      "active": true,
      "avatarUrls": {
       "16x16": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/5fca8aeffacfd6007656bf65/9af2a4f1-6b52-480b-a69f-d59b265be598/16",
       "24x24": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/5fca8aeffacfd6007656bf65/9af2a4f1-6b52-480b-a69f-d59b265be598/24",
       "32x32": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/5fca8aeffacfd6007656bf65/9af2a4f1-6b52-480b-a69f-d59b265be598/32",
       "48x48": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/5fca8aeffacfd6007656bf65/9af2a4f1-6b52-480b-a69f-d59b265be598/48"
      },
      "displayName": "Esmé Cowles",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=5fca8aeffacfd6007656bf65",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>I just verified that 4.7.2 builds fine for me, and bisected the commits between then and master.  It looks like the offending commit is <a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/commit/b00873e7d47ecf9f266e3628fcb9270e35edcc9c\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/commit/b00873e7d47ecf9f266e3628fcb9270e35edcc9c</a> (consolidating the spring config).  Maybe an unintentional change to the config is the source of the problem?</p>\n\n<p>Update: my mistake — of course it's the parallel rdf output: </p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/commit/cd5b69e2b8e85f13651fe7e88e88c6d7154105c6\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/commit/cd5b69e2b8e85f13651fe7e88e88c6d7154105c6</a></p>\n\n<p> </p>",
     "created": "20/May/17 7:41 AM",
     "id": "18813",
     "jsdPublic": true,
     "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/12378/comment/18813",
     "updateAuthor": {
      "accountId": "5fca8aeffacfd6007656bf65",
      "accountType": "atlassian",
      "active": true,
      "avatarUrls": {
