    {
     "author": {
      "accountId": "5fca8aeffacfd6007656bf65",
      "accountType": "atlassian",
      "active": true,
      "avatarUrls": {
       "16x16": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/5fca8aeffacfd6007656bf65/9af2a4f1-6b52-480b-a69f-d59b265be598/16",
       "24x24": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/5fca8aeffacfd6007656bf65/9af2a4f1-6b52-480b-a69f-d59b265be598/24",
       "32x32": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/5fca8aeffacfd6007656bf65/9af2a4f1-6b52-480b-a69f-d59b265be598/32",
       "48x48": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/5fca8aeffacfd6007656bf65/9af2a4f1-6b52-480b-a69f-d59b265be598/48"
      },
      "displayName": "Esmé Cowles",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=5fca8aeffacfd6007656bf65",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>When debugging parallel build failures in another PR, and then in master, I saw build failures in one or more of those tests mentioned in the description.  But none of them fail consistently.</p>\n\n<p>When I enable debug logging, I see the stacktrace for the errors is:</p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://gist.github.com/escowles/61ba8f628beca566c5332de19ce93c55\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://gist.github.com/escowles/61ba8f628beca566c5332de19ce93c55</a></p>\n\n<p>Since all of the tests that are failing are doing PUTs with RDF content, and none of the other tests are failing, I suspect FedoraResourceImpl.replaceProperties is involved.</p>",
     "created": "22/May/17 10:43 AM",
     "id": "18815",
     "jsdPublic": true,
     "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/12378/comment/18815",
