  "description": "<p>When doing a build with parallelization turned on (e.g.,  mvn -Dfcrepo.streaming.parallel=true clean install), I am seeing intermittent failures in these three ITs:</p>\n\n<p>  FedoraLdpIT.testReplaceGraph:765 expected:&lt;204&gt; but was:&lt;500&gt;<br/>\n  FedoraLdpIT.testRoundTripReplaceGraph:831 expected:&lt;204&gt; but was:&lt;500&gt;<br/>\n FedoraLdpIT.testRoundTripReplaceGraphForDatastreamDescription:1952 expected:&lt;204&gt; but was:&lt;500&gt;</p>\n\n<p>If I do the same build with parallization turned off, the build succeeds.</p>",
